    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.clue\n\n### Description\n\nThank you for mini.clue! After installing I noticed my config broke somewhat. The `apply_config()` function creates keymappings that are not configurable. I have mapped `Q` in normal mode to `:bd!<CR>`. This broke after using this module.\n\nSee:\n- https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/lua/mini/clue.lua#L1173\n- https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/lua/mini/clue.lua#L1180\n\nIt would be very nice to be able to configure this :)\n\n",
    "closed_at": "2025-01-17T16:10:05Z",
